    justice
    beauty
    freedom
    identity
    meaning
    culture
    fairness

These lack objective antonyms or stable polarity, so they cannot be
RDG or MFE primitives.


SECTION 9 — PIPELINE SUMMARY (FULL PROCESS)
---------------------------------------------------------------------
1. Gather compressed English primitives:
       NSM + WordNet + Basic English

2. Merge into candidate pool (~900–950 concepts)

3. Apply MFE bipolar antonym filter

4. Extract surviving bipolar pairs (~120–180 concepts)

5. Convert survivors into RDG triadic operators

6. Convert survivors into MFE bipolar flux polynomials

7. Build the unified RDG/MFE syntactic keyword set


